 a  precursor of sorts to the HTTP 3  protocol and as we start to roll out I  quick and the HTTP 3 protocol to the  entire cloud CDN fleet cloud CDN  customers will automatically have the  ability to leverage the  new protocol the benefit of using the  HTTP 3 protocol is going to improve not  only your time to first byte but also  improve the client performance and  stability for end-user clients  particularly on unstable networks so in  summary the cloud CDN platform is making  a lot of investment in our platform not  only in terms of enhancing and adding  new features and functionality to the  cloud CDN platform but we're also  looking at extending our  industry-leading performance  characteristics and capabilities  likewise were also making additional  investments in cloud CDN to revamp the  user experience so it's going to become  easier and more enriching environment  for you to use cloud CDN without having  to go to multiple different screens and  with that I want to thank you for  attending my presentation today and I  welcome to see you on a future  presentation

